[1.079221, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.644915, "o", "Initialized mnema project at ~/your-repository/.mnema\r\n"]
[1.645098, "o", "  identity: mnid:0185e54753d99660223440f3c280fb751e43597c39faf30ade2c0f634cb102e7\r\n"]
[1.645176, "o", "  backup key: created and enrolled — private half at ~/.mnema/identity/backup/350842172adac1c11fb883b6a4b82aac978363be58c52301a8d9ee6b76a50d1f.key\r\n  Move that file off this machine: a backup left on this disk is lost with it.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.645224, "o", "  mnema writes no file of yours. In Claude Code the mnema plugin hands this record to\r\n  each session on its own. Without it, `mnema brief > MNEMA.md` puts what governs this\r\n"]
[1.645295, "o", "  project in a file of its own — the `>` replaces the whole of the file it names — and\r\n  one line in a `CLAUDE.md` brings that file in (an `AGENTS.md` is read there only\r\n"]
[1.645345, "o", "  where no `CLAUDE.md` exists):\r\n"]
[1.645393, "o", "    @MNEMA.md\r\n"]
[3.25985, "o", "\u001b[2m# write down a call, with the reasoning and what was turned down\u001b[0m\r\n"]
